gp-arcade-input 0
# tapper-diagonal.input through MAME's 4-way filter (`joystick 4way`): the
# directions are pressed as a player's keys are, so MAME keeps one of them.
system rbtapper
joystick 4way
columns CSRLDUT
# power-on and attract mode
300 .......
# a coin, then start 1
6 C......
54 .......
6 .S.....
234 .......
# from rest straight to a diagonal: up and right
20 ..R..U.
10 .......
# left, then up as well: the change is up
10 ...L...
20 ...L.U.
10 .....U.
10 .......
# down, then right as well, then right alone
10 ....D..
20 ..R.D..
10 ..R....
10 .......
# opposing directions: up and down, left and right, then all four
10 ....DU.
10 ..RL...
10 ..RLDU.
10 .......
# pour, then left and up while tapping
20 ......T
20 ...L.UT
10 .......
# one diagonal to the other: up-left to up-right to down-right
10 ...L.U.
10 ..R..U.
10 ..R.D..
10 .......
# down, then left and down, then left alone, then down-left again
10 ....D..
10 ...LD..
10 ...L...
10 ...LD..
10 .......
# a few seconds more with taps and single moves
20 ......T
10 .......
6 ....D..
20 ......T
200 .......
